          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "в любом случае (v lyubóm slúchaye) is \"in any case\": любой \"any\", on the root of любить \"to love\", and случай \"a case\", from Proto-Slavic sŭlučajĭ (EtymDB)."
