          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "решаться (reshátsya) — \"to make up one’s mind, to dare\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Он никак не решается сказать ей правду. On nikák ne resháyetsya skazát yey právdu. He cannot bring himself to tell her the truth."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Imperfective; perfective решиться. Решаться на + accusative, or + infinitive. Not the same as решать, to solve or decide."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "решаться (reshátsya) is the reflexive of решать \"to decide\", inherited from Proto-Slavic rěšiti \"to untie, to loosen\": to make up your mind is to untie yourself from doubt."
            }
          ]
        },
