          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "в зависимости от (v zavísimosti ot) is built on зависимость \"dependence\", from зависеть \"to depend\", made of за- and висеть \"to hang\": one thing hangs on another."
            }
          ]
